{"about_the_game":"Swordy is a local party brawler with chaotic physics-based action. Master the weapons of war, using momentum and timing to fight for your life in a world built on the bones of a ruined empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e148bd2940ca.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=304 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e148bd2940ca.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e148bd2940ca.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/7d793cd033b67a9c2725cefb1d523b08.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=304 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/7d793cd033b67a9c2725cefb1d523b08.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/7d793cd033b67a9c2725cefb1d523b08.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/106d198ef492a5a096e1ce42323e7c4f.webp?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=56 /></span><br><br>Our unconventional twin stick control scheme lets you wreak havoc on your opponents. Analogue sticks and triggers directly translate into character and weapon control, enabling you to time your swings, throws and stabs. Swordy\u2019s weapons and damage model are completely physics based, you\u2019ll need to master the momentum and weight of your character and weapon together to fight effectively. It\u2019s easy to pick up but leaves a lot of space for mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/8562b7214a27293cb9d6f891784fec5d.webp?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=56 /></span><br><br>In Swordy you will wield and engage with a variety of weapon types and fighting tactics. Slashing, stabbing, piercing crushing, cleaving, throwing, and dual wielding are available in the form of swords, knives, hammers, flails, axes, shields and more as we develop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/25a2c739acb214c35c75d8d6f39898e9.avif?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=354 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/e30eac0aea7009d4b9dcb222b51a62e9.webp?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=56 /></span><br><br>We are working on a variety of competitive, cooperative and party game modes. You will be able to refine your skills against AI players, compete against your friends or fight together through the challenges of a harsh and mysterious land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/27435557514016fa8f2484961a746ef6.webp?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=56 /></span><br><br>The world of Swordy is set in the ruins of an ancient age. Forests, deserts, plains and mountains hold what\u2019s left of the sacred sites of cultures long since fallen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/9689f67e339dffd68693509f258aecad.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/9689f67e339dffd68693509f258aecad.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/9689f67e339dffd68693509f258aecad.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/467900?t=1512694861","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1512694861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1512694861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1512694861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Swordy is a local party brawler with chaotic physics-based action. Master the weapons of war, using momentum and timing to fight for your life in a world built on the bones of a ruined empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e148bd2940ca.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=304 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e148bd2940ca.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/0f3823ac62a964300f45e1